# Corpus content is byte-exact test data. Git must never touch it.
# See docs/testing/test-vault-spec.md section 6.
#
# Without this file, git normalizes line endings on checkout regardless
# of a contributor's core.autocrlf setting, and every EC-ENC-* case
# silently becomes EC-ENC-001. The corpus would then test nothing while
# still appearing to pass.

* -text -diff -export-subst

*.png binary
*.pdf binary
